        "Content": "A end of terrace two story house.\r\nComprising 1 x three bedroom and 1x two bedroom apartment.\r\nLocated within walking distance of all amenities in Bray.\r\nSituated a short distance from multiple Bus routes and Bray Dart station.\r\nRanging in size from approximately 55 sq. m (592 sq. ft) to 75 sq. m (807 sq. ft).\r\nExtending to approximately 130 sq. m (1,399 sq. ft.) in total.\r\nTransport links include multiple Dublin Bus routes, and M50 within easy reach via the M11/N11 motorway corridor\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThe property comprises 1 x three bedroom and 1 x two bedroom apartment located in Bray. The apartments range in size from approximately 55 sq. m (592 sq. ft) to 75 sq. m (897 sq. ft) and are comprised within a building arranged over ground and one upper floor. \r\n\r\nVacant possession."
